OL,3,GNEWSAMan who kept wife's body in
OL,4,Afreezer jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who murdered his wife with a
OL,7,Fhammer and hid her body in a chest
OL,8,Ffreezer while telling family and
OL,9,Ffriends she was ill in hospital has
OL,10,Fbeen jailed for life.
OL,12,FDavid Barraclough, 46, killed Carolann
OL,13,FBarraclough, a mother of three, at the
OL,14,Ffamily's house in Horbury, near
OL,15,FWakefield, in February.
OL,17,FLeeds Crown Court heard he then spent
OL,18,Fabout two weeks trying to conceal what
OL,19,Fhe had done, telling relatives and
OL,20,Ffriends she was in hospital and sending
OL,21,Fmessages from her phone pretending to
OL,22,Fbe her.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
