OL,3,GNEWSAMan who kept wife's body in
OL,4,Afreezer jailed for life
OL,5,
OL,6,FBarraclough pleaded guilty to murder on
OL,7,Fthe first day of his trial and refused
OL,8,Fto attend court for sentencing. He was
OL,9,Fjailed for life with a minimum term of
OL,10,F22 years and one month.
